OL,3,GNEWSAMillions to be spent on drive to
OL,4,Ahelp young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity leaders who will oversee how
OL,7,F#20m will be spent in areas of Coventry
OL,8,Fand Warwickshire said they were excited
OL,9,Fby how much change they will be able to
OL,10,Fdeliver.
OL,12,FJoanne Kerr and Will Davies, from Tile
OL,13,FHill Community Partnership, told BBC
OL,14,FCWR there will be a drive to help young
OL,15,Fchildren in the area.
