OL,3,GNEWSAMillions to be spent on drive to
OL,4,Ahelp young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FTile Hill, in Coventry, and Camp Hill,
OL,7,Fin Nuneaton, have been selected to
OL,8,Freceive the funding through the Pride
OL,9,Fin Place programme, a government scheme
OL,10,Fwhich gives money to disadvantaged
OL,11,Fareas and allows residents to choose
OL,12,Fwhere the money goes.
OL,14,FResidents in those areas are being
OL,15,Furged to come forward to have their say
OL,16,Fin what improvements they want to see.
